[[South Africa national rugby union team|South Africa]] had the most capped side in the World Cup with 1,224 caps. The most-capped player at the tournament was [[Brian O'Driscoll]] of [[Ireland national rugby union team|Ireland]], who entered the event with 113 caps for Ireland (not counting his appearances with the [[British and Irish Lions]]). Second on this list was his teammate [[Ronan O'Gara]] with 111.

